{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LORuhh-m_30GV8InqHUKlw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:17.282484+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LORuhh-m_30GV8InqHUKlw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/L5psiagWefDJXM3uoXVS534w4ibdF8q2EHqtOjypsUtulCmSEbRJN0jY8QjBVr8IKWHgr4HW6kx91IWgsJia9HEPjy1LeWysRKquL3b57RVsbU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>复旦大学人类表型组研究院传承百年复旦的创新基因，依托张江科学城一流的创新生态，成为复旦大学创新中心的核心平台之一和复旦大学世界一流生物学科的新兴增长极，全力打造人类表型组科学研究的领先机构、生命科学与生物技术尖端创新的策源重镇和引领发起国际大科学计划的核心力量。</span><span><strong><span>欢迎生物学、医学（预防医学、基础医学、临床医学）、生物医学工程、生物与医药、信息学、药学、化学、统计学、计算科学与大数据等相关专业优秀学生报名我院推免研究生！</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/L5psiagWefDJ4tlbBhU7HicMda16CFGKPt2SQQrsxyR2E9BTj94dTs3BCGA2uXRjiaTkjkciaxPFzPO4T0kYbxW3et49R84zwFamcsvRuoUOYSM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月6日 10:00 —— 2026年8月17日 17:00</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.全国各高等学校2027年应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2.学业成绩优秀，本科阶段总成绩排名在该校同年级本专业前20%，预期可获得推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>3.有志于从事人类表型学研究领域的应用和学术研究工作，并有一定的独立研究能力。</span></p><p><span>4.学风端正，品德良好、无任何违反法律法规、校纪校规行为。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、报名材料</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（1）近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150×200像素，大小500K以内。</span></p><p><span>（2）本科阶段历年成绩单（加盖教务处或院系公章），JPG或PDF格式。</span></p><p><span>（3）外语水平证明，如CET-4、CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</span></p><p><span>（4）有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作。</span></p><p><span>（5）《考生诚信考核承诺书》（从报考服务系统下载，手写签名后上传）。</span></p><p><span>（6）个人自述。包括个人简历，本科期间学习、科研、实践工作简介，对读研期间学习和未来职业规划的初步设想。1000字左右。</span></p><p><span>（7）申请直博生的考生还需提交两封正高（或具有相当专业技术职称专家）职称专家所签字出具的推荐信，具体按报考系统中的要求填写并提交。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、报名方式</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人登录复旦大学研究生招生网（https://gsao.fudan.edu.cn）, 通过“研究生报考服务系统”中的“推免生报名”进行网上报名。</span></p><p><span>本单位无须寄送纸质材料。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、考核时间及方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>考核时间：（暂定）9月上旬。</span></p><p><span>考核地点：线下考核，具体安排将以邮件形式通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、相关说明</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消申请资格并通报其本科院校。</span></p><p><span>2.申请人在录取当年入学报到前必须取得国家承认的本科毕业证书和学位证书，否则录取资格无效。</span></p><p><span>3.凡有意报考我单位2027级推免研究生的考生（含本校本科生）均需报名。如果上级部门和学校关于推免生招生报名有新要求，我单位将按新要求执行并及时通知申请人。</span></p><p><span>4.咨询方式：hupi_gs@fudan.edu.cn。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>▼</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/L5psiagWefDI6Q1HSz8s9SdK73zgiaKnO0jDJ7xDW84gzLcpIqHnLVicWmIUibBuEzVe72uV6FfSIyBJJGKZicPibQUbDvtjJxQOfWo5ibKM8Rd9UE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/L5psiagWefDLokB70IAkxLYraONqhMGs9NIKfvjE1wO6wERumicoKOBfc3hUBJxp7qJm0UJ74FZCu1Izop6Crloggiba2TPdOqZv6pSxo1BC28/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/L5psiagWefDLgicllFMYFbv9Mc7qoY140wibIEN9zbHBvhLyr2pI5xsrISibKE4GRNU2XyibhiawK5bXXq8Hv4HkJ34SBVSuiaOZYibv2x9MicmP5zibo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/L5psiagWefDI19nWeaO6NQsyqicibtr94N28HvcRzop9QSy8OnRzpX4ianYNy8iaWtBjXcsd2CRKX5PiaMxSAHZEqz4O8SabXDFIEFWgRNWrYxFH4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"4b6ec330